    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="0720" n="618" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg618"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Mexican Chargé to the Acting Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Mexican Embassy</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-07-06"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 6, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Honorable Sir</hi>: I have had the honor to receive
                    your note No. 60, of the 2d instant, in which you were pleased to reply to mine
                    of May 9 last, in regard to the claim made on behalf of the steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tabasqueño.</hi></p>
                <p>In reply I beg to inform you that I have already brought the substance of your
                    note to the knowledge of my Government for such action as may be proper.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José F. Godoy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
